{"server":"cn","storyId":"act19side_level_act19side_05_beg","groupId":"act19side","stageId":"act19side_05","title":"多萝西的承诺","storyCode":"DV-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d8471236b935a29b5ffe3bd8f05a5676b69713735a98701b8740ab996c6324f4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......缪尔赛思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有料到你在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱......歉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是博士提醒，我差一点亲手杀死你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是敌人想看见的吗？他们想让你变成杀害前同僚的凶手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能及时收手，除了博士出声提醒，还有她那句话的缘故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不要急着与任何人为敌”——她有意预告了缪尔赛思的出现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这解释了她之前的行为疑点。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她想引导我们找到缪尔赛思。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难不成她故意把缪尔赛思送了回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可刚才的情况明明很凶险，谁能保证缪尔赛思不会死在我们手上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，她不在乎缪尔赛思到底是死是活。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这对她来说是一场测试。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......测试动力甲的技术，也测试我和罗德岛的反应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在酒吧里说的每一句话都是对我的试探。"}]},{"label":"她想让塞雷娅加快行动。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她仍在引导我们走向对她有利的方向。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃呃......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缪尔赛思，你好些了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在好几个小时前给你注射了镇定剂，你在动力甲里面的时候已经基本恢复了清醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当前体验到的眩晕与麻痹，主要是缺氧和精神恐惧带来的后遗症。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经为你做了一些应急处理，但完全恢复还需要半个小时左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阻......阻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阻止？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阻止......谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想让我们阻止那个把你关进动力甲里的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那位黎博利吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"narration","text":"因为着急，缪尔赛思的额头和手背上冒出了细密的汗珠。\n她突然抓住了你的手，伴随着她的动作，水滴纷纷浮了起来，狠狠撞上你的衣襟。\n水在深色的布料上迅速洇开，组成了一行讯息。\n不是那个黎博利的名字，不是斐尔迪南，而是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......359。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_532_1","isRemote":false,"text":"359号基地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很少来这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好歹你送了我一张临时工牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“文献学顾问”——莱茵这种科技公司，真的需要这方面的顾问吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的心情很好，这是否说明，实验进展还不错？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别提实验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分钟。像我这样的人，一天下来，只有十分钟是我自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以把这时间花在跟孩子们打视频电话上，也可以用这短暂的时间和埃琳娜他们一起吃个晚饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我更喜欢什么都不做，就站在这里看看这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面只有街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，这就是一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像这样工作一整天，他们必定满身疲惫。为什么他们的脸上看不见沮丧，脚步也依然轻快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为“机会”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们相信自己的辛劳将有机会带给全家人更好的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......就跟城外那些拓荒者一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然，就像拓荒者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特里蒙，三驮镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"曾经只有三匹驮兽带着七个拓荒者，在这片土地上建起了第一个简陋的定居点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今呢？看看我们脚下的街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里聚集了最有活力的开拓者和开拓者们的后代。没有哪个国家富有哥伦比亚的进取精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哥伦比亚的繁荣给了人们信心，而人们日复一日地不断前进也会给哥伦比亚带来生机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要哥伦比亚保持飞速前进，那这片土地上每一个人的生活也都在前进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你们是怎么看我的。你，克丽斯腾，塞雷娅......你们都叫我“投机者”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能抓住机会的，可都是聪明人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否认，我喜欢站在这里，这个更高的位置，而不是下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我配得上我得到的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的项目带来财富，财富推动下一个项目，技术因此而不断进步——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们将站在其他所有国家前面，引领整个泰拉进入新的时代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那个时候，后人会竖起不朽的丰碑，上面将刻有我们的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胜利属于每一个开拓者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分钟快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可没给我说话的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"霍尔海雅，我知道你来找我是要说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原谅你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾，缪尔赛思，塞雷娅，帕尔维斯......还有你。我没有时间浪费在猜测你们各自的小心思上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西的实验距离成功只有一步之遥——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_522_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想要那个最后的结果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑、桑尼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西说过了，这里没有危险......你们为什么都掏出了弓弩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有危险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌比卡博士，你错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我们面前的就是最大的危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指......多萝西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你愿意听我们解释......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦你和两位医生让一让。我们的目标从来都不是你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃琳娜，我们上了这位领队先生的当。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才那场被阻止的针对乔伊丝的袭击，只是一场刻意的表演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他先后让我们看到了他的愤怒、他的犹豫和他的底线，只为了掩盖一件事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从始至终，他都做好了真正去犯罪的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有料到迈尔会动手。为了取得你们......尤其是乌比卡博士的信任，我原本安排了萨姆来扮演更过激的一方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，这些都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经如愿来到了这里，找到了问题的源头——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼，你策划那场绑架，又一路来到这里，是想杀了我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能不能问一问......为什么？"},{"type":"narration","text":"依旧是温柔到能渗进最坚硬的心脏里的声音。\n还有那双湿润的、微微睁大的眼睛。\n那么无辜，那么惊讶，甚至带着一丝受伤。\n就好像该被指责的是被迫拿起武器自卫的他们一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......你问我为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我都看见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你造出来的怪物一路追杀我们，你用我的同伴们的鲜血喂养这些怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个......邪恶的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并不存在什么怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些只是实验的副产物，由一种对神经信号敏感的特殊物质构成......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，埃琳娜，这不是桑尼的臆测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的意思恐怕是，他的确早就见过那些银色物体......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三天前，我偷偷溜进了实验区......我想来找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......呃，那时候我想来问问你，我能不能报名成为受试者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领队，你不是说，成为受试者有很大风险，这些大公司很可能在骗我们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"风险......哈......哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起。萨姆，我是个言行不一致的混蛋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我想纠正我曾经的错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听着，各位——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一夜，我看到银色的怪物在她身边凝聚成形，她对它们说话，就好像那是她的宠物一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多萝西·弗兰克斯就是这场灾难的始作俑者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g3_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛丽女士，我说的这些，您是不是很难接受？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不是喜欢看科幻电影的那类人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那或许您可以看一眼这封信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼先生跟我巡完线之后，可能料到了之后会有危险，把这封信交给了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说——“万一我出事了，请把这封信交给玛丽·班纳”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他应该不介意......您提前看到信的内容吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，信上......说了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那家伙到底去了哪里？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格雷伊，你并不了解桑尼·罗马诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的内心充满了愤恨。因为那份该死的保险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是保险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，在哥伦比亚，这是个刻在所有感染者脑子里的词语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许......很多外头的人会觉得哥伦比亚对感染者已经足够仁慈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“只要能支付医疗保险费用，就可以获得后续正常生活的保障”——听起来是不是还挺公正的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼在刚得病的时候也是这么对我说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是结果呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格雷伊","speakerId":"avg_1027_greyy2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是不是一笔......非常巨额的费用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道就算我当一辈子警察，不吃不喝都负担不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那玩意儿就不是用来保障感染者生活的......巨额保费与他们能得到的药品完全不匹配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是一笔罚款，一条隐藏的规则，用来变相逼迫感染者走上被设定好的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼......罗马诺那家伙从来不肯正视现实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛丽","speakerId":"avg_npc_527_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不阻止他的话，他真的有可能犯下不可饶恕的罪行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g5_laboratory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼，你看到的并不是怪物，也不是我的宠物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们的确与我的实验有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你承认了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真相对你们而言并无益处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道得越多，你们就越危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......替别人做决定，是不是你们这些上层人士最爱做的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先放下这些利器好不好？仪器都很脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者请瞄准这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不介意的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她朝拓荒者们走了一步，弓弩几乎碰到了她的身体。\n桑尼的手微微颤抖了一下，他强迫自己将视线从那双温和的眼睛上移开。\n这也是邪恶的伎俩，是迫使他们再次屈服的法术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不怕死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我更怕你们伤害自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼，你不是凶手，你的同伴们也不是。你们只是一群想过上更好生活的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是也想过参加我的实验吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有机会的。只要加入我们，你就能得到你最渴望的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我永远不会对你们说不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她向拓荒者们伸出了一只手，仿佛正在等待他们握上去。\n她难道不明白，他们是来杀她的吗？\n不能看她。她的眼睛，她的手，全都不能看。太柔软了。\n自从不得不走上荒野，城市和城市里的人都在冷硬地说着拒绝。\n她正在控制他们。她就是这样控制住了那些可悲的意志软弱的同伴。\n可是“机会”......\n这个词语，我们有多久没听见了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"形状奇特的物体","speakerId":"avg_npc_533_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那些银色造物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃琳娜","speakerId":"avg_135_halo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们是怎么跟过来的？我没有看见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......桑尼是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这间实验室就是它们的诞生地......而且，你不觉得奇怪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_108_silent_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们......好像在保护多萝西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下来，不要伤害彼此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"形状奇特的物体","speakerId":"avg_npc_533_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拓荒队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_534_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领队，那边还有更多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"避开它们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住多萝西·弗兰克斯——不，优先攻击这间实验室！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"桑尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_535_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有破坏这邪恶的温床，才能消灭掉那些怪物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桑尼，只有这件事，我不能同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实验必须继续下去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多萝西","speakerId":"avg_4048_doroth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我对你们......对他们的承诺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
